WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.175 --> 00:00:02.747
- PortoVino Wine Purses
are blowing up on Facebook

00:00:02.747 --> 00:00:04.023
and Instagram.

00:00:04.023 --> 00:00:05.773
And so I ordered one.

00:00:25.981 --> 00:00:27.943
- [Justine] So let's
take it out of the box

00:00:27.943 --> 00:00:30.276
and see what we've got here.

00:00:31.569 --> 00:00:33.196
Here we have it.

00:00:33.196 --> 00:00:34.757
So here's the little bladder

00:00:34.757 --> 00:00:36.513
that we're supposed to put wine in.

00:00:36.513 --> 00:00:38.013
I don't like wine.

00:00:39.757 --> 00:00:41.451
I brought some beer with me

00:00:41.451 --> 00:00:43.917
and we're going to put it in this bladder.

00:00:43.917 --> 00:00:45.162
And see if it works.

00:00:45.162 --> 00:00:46.342
But wait there's more.

00:00:46.342 --> 00:00:47.587
In order to use it right?

00:00:47.587 --> 00:00:48.685
This thing goes in here

00:00:48.685 --> 00:00:51.579
and then this little spout
is where the wine comes out.

00:00:51.579 --> 00:00:53.314
So you need a cup to use it.

00:00:53.314 --> 00:00:56.011
I don't carry a glass around
with me and neither do you.

00:00:56.011 --> 00:01:00.326
I'm gonna see if I can Macgyver
this hose straw unto it.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:02.243
So that I can carry this
bag around for the day

00:01:02.243 --> 00:01:05.576
and drink beer while I'm walking around.

00:01:20.874 --> 00:01:22.230
I mean it doesn't look pretty

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:24.040
'cause I used white gaff tape.

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:25.540
But as you can see

00:01:26.755 --> 00:01:29.465
I've got the beer bladder here,

00:01:29.465 --> 00:01:30.930
inside this little compartment

00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:33.875
and it looks like the
lining of this compartment

00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:37.437
has insulation so at least it's
gonna keep your drinks cold,

00:01:37.437 --> 00:01:39.369
if that's what you want.

00:01:39.369 --> 00:01:41.369
Let's see if this works.

00:01:45.228 --> 00:01:46.061
It works.

00:01:46.061 --> 00:01:46.894
It's a little foamy.

00:01:46.894 --> 00:01:48.832
Beer isn't meant to move around this much

00:01:48.832 --> 00:01:50.415
which is why this works for wine.

00:01:50.415 --> 00:01:53.294
But I have to say this
isn't that bad of an option.

00:01:53.294 --> 00:01:56.707
Let's see what my coworkers think.

00:01:56.707 --> 00:01:58.473
- [Justine] Does it work?

00:01:58.473 --> 00:02:00.139
- Yeah.
(Justine laughs)

00:02:00.139 --> 00:02:02.090
Oh my gosh I need one of these.

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:03.785
I'll be putting some wine in here though.

00:02:03.785 --> 00:02:05.246
Or like a little mixed drink.

00:02:14.391 --> 00:02:15.404
- I think we're going to
take it to the streets

00:02:15.404 --> 00:02:18.404
to see if it works out in Hollywood.

00:02:22.902 --> 00:02:23.735
- [Justine] Hey guys.

00:02:23.735 --> 00:02:24.568
- Hey.

00:02:24.568 --> 00:02:26.315
- [Justine] What do you
think of my wine purse?

00:02:42.943 --> 00:02:45.101
- Wine, beer, Gatorade, water.

00:02:45.101 --> 00:02:46.332
Put whatever you want in it.

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:50.165
Keep yourself hydrated,
don't drink and drive.

